    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 121,
      "text": "Chapter 121"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Re-bought the materials out of leaf income. The failure cost eleven stones and nine days, and it did not cost me Moonlight Gu, which is the only line in that sentence that mattered.",
